# Dataset

This project uses the **VQA-RAD** dataset for Medical Visual Question Answering.

Due to data size and usage restrictions, the dataset is not included in this repository.

Please download the dataset from the official source:

- VQA-RAD (Visual Question Answering Radiology): https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shashankshekhar1205/vqa-rad-visual-question-answering-radiology
